          "content": "of menstrual hygiene and healthy sanitary habits. What menstrual hygiene and sanitary habits would you suggest to your friends?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.127,
            0.143,
            0.744,
            0.294
          ],
          "content": "8. Mary and Manoj were classmates and good friends. On turning 11, Mary developed a little bulge on the front of her neck. She visited the doctor who gave her medication and asked to take iodine-rich diet. Similarly, a bump was developed on the front of Manoj’s neck when he turned 12. However, the doctor told him that it was a part of growing up. According to you, what could be the possible reason for advising Mary and Manoj differently?"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.128,
            0.296,
            0.743,
            0.336
          ],
          "content": "9. During adolescence, the boys and girls undergo certain physical changes, a few of which are given below."
        },
        {
          "type": "page_number",
          "bbox": [
            0.947,
            0.05,
            0.981,
            0.07
          ],
          "content": "87"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.339,
            0.359,
            0.36
          ],
          "content": "(i) Change in voice"
